make said be a table called "said"
empty the table said

when someone connects
    tell them "welcome - {how many are connected} here"
    tell everyone else "somebody joined"
end

when someone says something
    make words be what they said
    save { words: words } in said
    tell everyone "someone said: {words}"
end

when someone disconnects
    show "someone left, {how many are connected} left"
end

every 2 seconds on the server
    show "tick - {number of rows in said} things said so far"
end

when someone visits "/"
    if this visitor has asked more than 3 times in 10 seconds
        answer with "slow down" and code 429
    otherwise
        answer with "hello"
    end
end

start serving on port 3020
